{
  "meta": {
    "site": "https://github.com/zengfr/n8n-workflow-all-templates",
    "tokenfree": "https://tokenyep.com/",
    "name": "Format, brand, and normalize social videos with Brand-Pipe",
    "wechat": "youandme10086",
    "id": 19684,
    "update_time": "2026-09-27"
  },
  "name": "Make AI videos Shorts-ready (9:16, logo, loudness) without ffmpeg, works on n8n Cloud",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-1001-4000-8000-000000000011",
      "name": "Sticky: credential",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        340,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 320,
        "height": 250,
        "content": "## 2. Add the credential\nCreate a **Header Auth** credential named `Brand-Pipe API Key` with name `X-API-Key` and your key as the value, then select it on the *Brand-Pipe process* node. Get a key with 25 free credits at https://www.brand-pipe.com."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-1002-4000-8000-000000000012",
      "name": "Sticky: values",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 320,
        "height": 250,
        "content": "## 1. Replace the values\nSwap the four fields in *Set video* for the output of your own generator node (Kling, Sora, Runway, an S3 link, anything reachable over HTTPS); `format` is `vertical`, `square` or `landscape`."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-1003-4000-8000-000000000013",
      "name": "Sticky: output",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        680,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 340,
        "height": 250,
        "content": "## 3. Connect the binary output\n*Download result* puts the finished MP4 into the binary property `video`; connect your YouTube, TikTok or storage node to it. The lower branch stops the run with the message from the API, and failed jobs are refunded (except an encode that hits the time limit)."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Run",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "position": [
        40,
        380
      ],
      "parameters": {},
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0002-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Set video",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "notes": "Replace these values with the output of your video generator node.",
      "position": [
        260,
        380
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "f1",
              "name": "video_url",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "https://test-videos.co.uk/vids/bigbuckbunny/mp4/h264/360/Big_Buck_Bunny_360_10s_1MB.mp4"
            },
            {
              "id": "f2",
              "name": "logo_url",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "https://www.brand-pipe.com/logo.png"
            },
            {
              "id": "f3",
              "name": "format",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "vertical"
            },
            {
              "id": "f4",
              "name": "audio_normalize",
              "type": "boolean",
              "value": true
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0003-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Brand-Pipe process",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "notes": "Credential: Header Auth, name X-API-Key, value your key. Timeout 5 min covers long clips.",
      "position": [
        480,
        380
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://api.brand-pipe.com/v1/process",
        "method": "POST",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        },
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ video_url: $json.video_url, logo_url: $json.logo_url, format: $json.format, audio_normalize: $json.audio_normalize }) }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Idempotency-Key",
              "value": "={{ JSON.stringify({ video_url: $json.video_url, logo_url: $json.logo_url, format: $json.format, audio_normalize: $json.audio_normalize }).hash('sha256') }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "name": "Brand-Pipe API Key"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.2
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0004-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Success?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "position": [
        700,
        380
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "version": 2,
            "leftValue": "",
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.success }}",
              "rightValue": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        "looseTypeValidation": true
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.2
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0005-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Download result",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "notes": "Binary property 'video' holds the finished MP4. Connect your YouTube / TikTok / storage node here.",
      "position": [
        920,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $json.data.result_url }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "file",
              "outputPropertyName": "video"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.2
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0006-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "Stop with error",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stopAndError",
      "position": [
        920,
        470
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "errorMessage": "=Brand-Pipe error: {{ $json.error }}"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
  ],
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "connections": {
    "Run": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Set video",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Success?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Download result",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Stop with error",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Set video": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Brand-Pipe process",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Brand-Pipe process": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Success?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  }
}